    "Hesab\u0131m\u0131 Sil": "Fshi Llogarin\u00eb Time", // EN: Delete My Account
    "Hesab\u0131n, profilin ve senkronize verilerin kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinir. Aktif NEXUS+ aboneli\u011fin varsa \u00f6nce Faturaland\u0131rma'dan iptal et. Bu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz.": "Llogaria juaj, profili dhe t\u00eb dh\u00ebnat e sinkronizuara jan\u00eb fshir\u00eb p\u00ebrgjithmon\u00eb. N\u00ebse keni nj\u00eb abonim aktiv NEXUS+, anuloni at\u00eb nga Blerjet paraprakisht. Kjo nuk mund t\u00eb zhb\u00ebhet.", // EN: Your account, profile and synced data are permanently deleted. If you have an active NEXUS+ subscription, cancel it from Billing first. This cannot be undone.
    "Emin misin? Tekrar dokunarak sil": "Jeni i sigurt? Shtypni p\u00ebrs\u00ebri p\u00ebr t\u00eb fshir\u00eb", // EN: Are you sure? Tap again to delete
    "Siliniyor\u2026": "Duke fshir\u00eb\u2026", // EN: Deleting…
    "Hesap silindi. Aboneli\u011fini Whop hesab\u0131ndan iptal etmeyi unutma.": "Llogaria u fshi. Mos harroni t\u00eb anuloni abonimin tuaj nga llogaria juaj Whop.", // EN: Account deleted. Remember to cancel your subscription from your Whop account.
    "Hesab\u0131n ve verilerin silindi.": "Llogaria dhe t\u00eb dh\u00ebnat tuaja u fshin\u00eb.", // EN: Your account and data were deleted.
    "Bu cihazdaki NEXUS verilerini silmek i\u00e7in Ayarlar \u2192 \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Yap yeterli; bulut hesab\u0131 yok.": "P\u00ebr t\u00eb hequr t\u00eb dh\u00ebnat NEXUS n\u00eb k\u00ebt\u00eb pajisje, mjafton Cil\u00ebsimet \u2192 Dil; nuk ka nj\u00eb llogari cloud.", // EN: To remove NEXUS data on this device, Settings → Sign out is enough; there is no cloud account.
    "Hesap silme fonksiyonu hen\u00fcz da\u011f\u0131t\u0131lmad\u0131. \u015eimdilik \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Fshirja e llogaris\u00eb nga ana e serverit nuk \u00ebsht\u00eb zbatuar ende. Mund t\u00eb dilni p\u00ebr tani.", // EN: The server-side account deletion isn't deployed yet. You can sign out for now.
    "! Rahats\u0131z etme modunu a\u00e7t\u0131m, hi\u00e7bir bildirim seni rahats\u0131z etmeyecek. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]": "! Aktivizova Mos Shkaktoni T\u00ebrheqje; nuk do t\u2019ju shqet\u00ebsojn\u00eb njoftimet. [VEPRIM: AKTIVIZO_DND]", // EN: ! I turned on Do Not Disturb; no notifications will bother you. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]
    "\" senaryosunu \u015fimdilik ana ekrandaki T\u0131kla ve \u00c7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r kart\u0131ndan tek dokunu\u015fla \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rabilirsin. NEXUS App Store'da yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bu ekrandan do\u011frudan Siri'ye ekleyebileceksin.": "\" skenari mund t\u00eb ekzekutohet me nj\u00eb trokitje nga karta Tap to Run n\u00eb ekranin kryesor p\u00ebr tani. Pasi NEXUS t\u00eb jet\u00eb n\u00eb App Store, do t\u00eb jeni n\u00eb gjendje ta shtoni at\u00eb n\u00eb Siri direkt nga ky ekran.", // EN: " scenario can be run with one tap from the Tap to Run card on the home screen for now. Once NEXUS is on the App Store, you'll be able to add it to Siri directly from this screen.
