    "Durum okunmad\u0131": "Gjendja nuk u lexua", // EN: State not read
    "Bu zaten \u015fu an kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131n e-posta adresi. Farkl\u0131 bir adres gir.": "Kjo tashm\u00eb \u00ebsht\u00eb adresa e post\u00ebs elektronike q\u00eb po p\u00ebrdorni. Shkruani nj\u00eb tjet\u00ebr.", // EN: This is already the email address you are using. Enter a different one.
    "Bu e-posta adresi ba\u015fka bir hesapta kay\u0131tl\u0131. Ba\u015fka bir adres dene.": "Kjo adres\u00eb email \u00ebsht\u00eb regjistruar n\u00eb nj\u00eb llogari tjet\u00ebr. Provoni nj\u00eb tjet\u00ebr.", // EN: This email address is registered to another account. Try a different one.
    "\u00c7ok s\u0131k denendi. Birka\u00e7 dakika sonra tekrar dene.": "Shum\u00eb p\u00ebrpjekje. Provoni p\u00ebrs\u00ebri pas disa minutash.", // EN: Too many attempts. Try again in a few minutes.
    "\u00c7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131": "Jasht\u00eb linje", // EN: Offline
