    "Ekledi\u011fin cihazlar hen\u00fcz s\u0131cakl\u0131k, nem veya hava kalitesi verisi vermedi. Sens\u00f6r\u00fcn a\u00e7\u0131k ve a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Pajisjet tuaja nuk kan\u00eb raportuar ende temperatur\u00ebn, lag\u00ebshtin\u00eb ose cil\u00ebsin\u00eb e ajrit. Sigurohuni q\u00eb sensori t\u00eb jet\u00eb ndezur dhe i lidhur me rrjetin.", // EN: Your devices have not reported temperature, humidity or air quality yet. Make sure the sensor is on and on the network.
    "Son okunan \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcmler": "Lexime t\u00eb fundit", // EN: Latest readings
