    "Haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011f\u0131 bitirdi\u011finde \u015fu cihazlara uygulan\u0131r.": "Kur t\u00eb p\u00ebrfundoni, kjo aplikohet p\u00ebr pajisjet e m\u00ebposhtme.", // EN: When you finish, this is applied to the following devices.
    "Uyku haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\u00e7in uygun cihaz yok": "Asnj\u00eb pajisje e p\u00ebrshtatshme p\u00ebr p\u00ebrgatitjen p\u00ebr gjum\u00eb", // EN: No suitable device for sleep preparation
    "I\u015f\u0131k, perde, kilit veya iklim cihaz\u0131 ekledi\u011finde haz\u0131rl\u0131k burada listelenir.": "Pasi t\u00eb shtoni nj\u00eb llamb\u00eb, perde, ky\u00e7 ose pajisje klimaterike, p\u00ebrgatitja shfaqet k\u00ebtu.", // EN: Once you add a light, curtain, lock or climate device, the preparation is listed here.
    "\u0130klim cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n son bilinen durumu ve okunan \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcmler.": "Gjendja dhe leximet e fundit t\u00eb pajisjeve tuaja klimaterike.", // EN: Last known state and readings of your climate devices.
