    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizler ve enerji odakl\u0131 cihazlar i\u00e7in h\u0131zl\u0131 tasarruf ak\u0131\u015flar\u0131.": "Rrjedha t\u00eb kursimit t\u00eb shpejt\u00eb p\u00ebr prizat e zgjuara dhe pajisjet e fokusuar te energjia.", // EN: Quick saving flows for smart plugs and energy-focused devices.
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizler ve enerji t\u00fcketen cihazlar\u0131 tek merkezde topla. Hemen uygulanabilen tasarruf profilleri ve zamanl\u0131 eko aksiyonlar\u0131 olu\u015ftur.": "Bashko prizat e zgjuara dhe pajisjet q\u00eb konsumojn\u00eb energji n\u00eb nj\u00eb vend. Krijo profile kursimi t\u00eb menj\u00ebhersh\u00ebm dhe veprime ekolo t\u00eb planifikuara.", // EN: Bring smart plugs and energy-consuming devices together in one place. Create instant saving profiles and scheduled eco actions.
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizleri ve enerji t\u00fcketen cihazlar\u0131 y\u00f6neten bir enerji tasarruf paneli olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma, eko profiller, zamanlanm\u0131\u015f tasarruf ve t\u00fcketim \u00f6zetleri ekle.": "Krijo nj\u00eb panel kursimi energjie q\u00eb menaxhon prizat dhe pajisjet q\u00eb konsumojn\u00eb energji. Shto fikje t\u00eb shpejt\u00eb, profile ekolo, kursime t\u00eb planifikuara dhe p\u00ebrmbledhje p\u00ebrdorimi.", // EN: Create an energy saving panel that manages smart plugs and energy-consuming devices. Add quick shut-off, eco profiles, scheduled saving and usage summaries.
