    "Cihaz uyar\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131, \u00e7a\u011fr\u0131 kay\u0131tlar\u0131n\u0131 ve \u00f6nemli durum mesajlar\u0131n\u0131 tek merkezden takip edin.": "Ndjekni alarme t\u00eb pajisjeve, regjistrimet e thirrjeve dhe mesazhet e r\u00ebnd\u00ebsishme t\u00eb statusit nga nj\u00eb qend\u00ebr.", // EN: Track device alerts, call logs and important status messages from one center.
