    "E-posta uygulamanda mesaj\u0131n haz\u0131r; g\u00f6nderdi\u011finde bize ula\u015f\u0131r. NEXUS'u birlikte daha iyi yap\u0131yoruz.": "Mesazhi juaj \u00ebsht\u00eb gati n\u00eb aplikacionin tuaj t\u00eb email-it; na arrin kur e d\u00ebrgoni. Po e b\u00ebjm\u00eb NEXUS m\u00eb t\u00eb mir\u00eb s\u00eb bashku.", // EN: Your message is ready in your email app; it reaches us when you send it. We're making NEXUS better together.
