    "Ev Panosu evin \u00fcyeleri aras\u0131ndad\u0131r. Ev Y\u00f6netimi'nden ev olu\u015ftur ya da davetle kat\u0131l.": "Bordi i p\u00ebrket an\u00ebtar\u00ebve t\u00eb sht\u00ebpis\u00eb suaj. Krijoni nj\u00eb sht\u00ebpi nga Menaxhimi i Sht\u00ebpis\u00eb ose bashkohuni me ftes\u00eb.", // EN: The board belongs to your home's members. Create a home from Home Management or join by invite.
    "Bu madde panodan t\u00fcm \u00fcyeler i\u00e7in kald\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r.": "Ky artikull \u00ebsht\u00eb hequr nga bordi p\u00ebr t\u00eb gjith\u00eb an\u00ebtar\u00ebt.", // EN: This item is removed from the board for all members.
