    "NEXUS AI al\u0131\u015fkanl\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 \u00f6\u011frenir ve evinizi size \u00f6zel m\u00fckemmel bir ya\u015fam alan\u0131na d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcr\u00fcr.": "NEXUS AI m\u00ebson zakonet tuaja dhe e transformon sht\u00ebpin\u00eb tuaj n\u00eb nj\u00eb hap\u00ebsir\u00eb t\u00eb jetes\u00ebs t\u00eb b\u00ebr\u00eb vet\u00ebm p\u00ebr ju.", // EN: NEXUS AI learns your habits and turns your home into a living space made just for you.
    "NEXUS AI ile her \u015feyi olu\u015fturun": "Krijo \u00e7do gj\u00eb me NEXUS AI", // EN: Create anything with NEXUS AI
    "NEXUS AI ile sohbet et": "Bisedo me NEXUS AI", // EN: Chat with NEXUS AI
    "NEXUS AI ile yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z her g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fme puan kullan\u0131r. Puanlar her g\u00fcn yenilenir.": "\u00c7do bised\u00eb me NEXUS AI p\u00ebrdor pik\u00eb. Pik\u00ebt rinovohen \u00e7do dit\u00eb.", // EN: Each conversation with NEXUS AI uses points. Points renew every day.
    "NEXUS AI puanlar\u0131 nedir?": "\u00c7far\u00eb jan\u00eb pik\u00ebt NEXUS AI?", // EN: What are NEXUS AI points?
    "NEXUS AI puanlar\u0131n her g\u00fcn yenilenir; \u015fu an t\u00fcm \u00f6zellikler \u00fccretsiz.": "Pik\u00ebt tuaja NEXUS AI rinovohen \u00e7do dit\u00eb; \u00e7do ve\u00e7ori \u00ebsht\u00eb falas tani.", // EN: Your NEXUS AI points renew every day; every feature is free right now.
