    "NEXUS i\u00e7inde \"Bir Eve Kat\u0131l\" alan\u0131na bu kodu girerek kat\u0131labilirsin.": "Mund t\u00eb bashkoheni duke futur k\u00ebt\u00eb kod n\u00eb \"Bashko nj\u00eb Sht\u00ebpi\" brenda NEXUS.", // EN: You can join by entering this code in "Join a Home" inside NEXUS.
    "NEXUS senaryolar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 Siri komutlar\u0131yla saniyeler i\u00e7inde sesle \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n.": "Ekzekutoni skenar\u00ebt tuaj NEXUS me z\u00eb me Siri brenda sekondave.", // EN: Run your NEXUS scenarios by voice with Siri in seconds.
    "NEXUS yerel \u00f6ncelikli \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r: cihaz verilerin bu cihazda kal\u0131r, cihaz komutlar\u0131 do\u011frudan yerel a\u011fdan gider ve \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraflarla payla\u015f\u0131lmaz.": "NEXUS \u00ebsht\u00eb primar lokal: t\u00eb dh\u00ebnat e pajisjes tuaj mbeten n\u00eb k\u00ebt\u00eb pajisje, komandat e pajisjes shkojn\u00eb drejtp\u00ebrdrejt mbi rrjetin tuaj lokal, dhe asgj\u00eb nuk shp\u00ebrndahet me pal\u00eb t\u00eb treta.", // EN: NEXUS is local-first: your device data stays on this device, device commands go straight over your local network, and nothing is shared with third parties.
