    "NEXUS'u di\u011fer platformlara ba\u011flayarak cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 her yerden kontrol et.": "Lidh NEXUS me platformat e tjera p\u00ebr t\u00eb kontrolluar pajisjet tuaja nga kudo.", // EN: Connect NEXUS to other platforms to control your devices from anywhere.
    "Bu hizmet ba\u011flant\u0131lar\u0131 hen\u00fcz kullan\u0131labilir de\u011fil. \u00dc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraf cihazlar i\u00e7in Entegrasyonlar'dan Home Assistant'\u0131 kullanabilirsin.": "K\u00ebto lidhje sh\u00ebrbimesh nuk jan\u00eb t\u00eb disponueshme akoma. P\u00ebr pajisjet e pal\u00ebve t\u00eb treta, mund t\u00eb p\u00ebrdorni Home Assistant nga Integrimet.", // EN: These service connections are not available yet. For third-party devices, you can use Home Assistant from Integrations.
