    "NEXUS+ hen\u00fcz sat\u0131\u015fta de\u011fil. Cihaz ekleme, kontrol panelleri, senaryolar ve NEXUS AI \u015fu an tamamen \u00fccretsiz; abonelik a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda buradan haber verece\u011fiz.": "NEXUS+ nuk \u00ebsht\u00eb n\u00eb shitje akoma. Shtimi i pajisjeve, skenar\u00ebve dhe NEXUS AI \u00ebsht\u00eb plot\u00ebsisht falas tani; do t'ju njoftojm\u00eb k\u00ebtu kur abonimet t\u00eb hapen.", // EN: NEXUS+ isn't on sale yet. Adding devices, scenarios and NEXUS AI are completely free right now; we'll let you know here when subscriptions open.
