    "Bu adreste bir cihaz var ama NEXUS protokol\u00fc konu\u015fmuyor.": "Ka nj\u00eb pajisje n\u00eb k\u00ebt\u00eb adres\u00eb, por nuk flet protokollin NEXUS.", // EN: There is a device at this address, but it does not speak a NEXUS protocol.
    "Bu cihaz zaten ekli.": "Kjo pajisje \u00ebsht\u00eb tashm\u00eb e shtuar.", // EN: This device is already added.
    "E\u015fle\u015ftir ve ekle": "Pajto dhe shto", // EN: Pair and add
    "E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodu ge\u00e7ersiz. 11 haneli kodu ya da MT: ile ba\u015flayan QR i\u00e7eri\u011fini gir.": "Kodi i pajtimit nuk \u00ebsht\u00eb i vlefsh\u00ebm. Fut kodin 11-shifror ose p\u00ebrmbajtjen QR q\u00eb fillon me MT:.", // EN: The pairing code is not valid. Enter the 11-digit code or the QR content that starts with MT:.
    "Bu kodu NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda gir. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011fl\u0131ysa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle de ekleyebilirsin.": "Fut k\u00ebt\u00eb kod n\u00eb aplikacionin desktop NEXUS. N\u00ebse pajisja \u00ebsht\u00eb n\u00eb Wi-Fi, mund ta shtosh gjithashtu nga rrjeti lokal sipas adres\u00ebs s\u00eb saj IP.", // EN: Enter this code in the NEXUS desktop app. If the device is on Wi-Fi, you can also add it from your local network by its IP address.
    "Cihaz ayn\u0131 a\u011fda aran\u0131yor ve e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor. Bu bir dakikay\u0131 bulabilir; cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda olmas\u0131 gerekir.": "Pajisja po k\u00ebrkohet n\u00eb t\u00eb nj\u00ebjtin rrjet dhe po pajtohet. Kjo mund t\u00eb zgjas\u00eb deri n\u00eb nj\u00eb minut\u00eb; pajisja duhet t\u00eb jet\u00eb ndezur dhe n\u00eb modalitetin e pajtimit.", // EN: The device is being searched for on the same network and paired. This can take up to a minute; the device must be on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131 ya da e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Nuk u gjet pajisja ose nuk mund t\u00eb \u00e7ift\u00ebzohej. Sigurohuni q\u00eb t\u00eb jet\u00eb n\u00eb t\u00eb nj\u00ebjtin rrjet, e ndezur dhe n\u00eb modalitetin e \u00e7ift\u00ebzimit.", // EN: The device was not found or could not be paired. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol. Bilgisayar\u0131n g\u00fcvenlik duvar\u0131 yerel a\u011fdaki cihazlar\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor olabilir.": "Nuk u gjet pajisja. Sigurohuni q\u00eb t\u00eb jet\u00eb n\u00eb t\u00eb nj\u00ebjtin rrjet, e ndezur dhe n\u00eb modalitetin e \u00e7ift\u00ebzimit. Firewall-i i kompjuterit tuaj mund t\u00eb po bllokon p\u00ebrgjigjet nga pajisjet n\u00eb rrjetin lokal.", // EN: The device was not found. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode. Your computer's firewall may be blocking replies from devices on the local network.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodunu ve cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011funu kontrol et.": "Pajisja nuk mund t\u00eb \u00e7ift\u00ebzohej. Kontrolloni kodin e \u00e7ift\u00ebzimit dhe q\u00eb pajisja \u00ebsht\u00eb n\u00eb modalitetin e \u00e7ift\u00ebzimit.", // EN: The device could not be paired. Check the pairing code and that the device is in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015fti ama NEXUS'un kontrol edebilece\u011fi bir i\u015flevi yok.": "Pajisja u \u00e7ift\u00ebzua por nuk ka funksione q\u00eb NEXUS mund t\u00eb kontrolloj\u00eb.", // EN: The device paired but has no function NEXUS can control.
    "Cihaz yan\u0131t vermedi. A\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Pajisja nuk u p\u00ebrgjigj. Sigurohuni q\u00eb \u00ebsht\u00eb e ndezur dhe n\u00eb t\u00eb nj\u00ebjtin rrjet.", // EN: The device did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network.
