    "TV odas\u0131 i\u00e7in k\u0131s\u0131k parlakl\u0131kta sinema sahnesi olu\u015ftur.": "Krijoni nj\u00eb sken\u00eb t\u00eb zbehur kinemaje p\u00ebr dhom\u00ebn e TV.", // EN: Create a dimmed cinema scene for the TV room.
    "TV ve medya cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in bir sinema modu uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. Film ba\u015flat, ses seviyesi, ortam \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve dikkat da\u011f\u0131tmayan gece e\u011flence k\u0131sayollar\u0131 olsun.": "Krijoni nj\u00eb aplikacion me m\u00ebnyr\u00eb kinemaje p\u00ebr TV dhe pajisje mediatike. P\u00ebrfshini fillimin e filmit, volumin, dritat ambientale dhe shkurtoret p\u00ebr arg\u00ebtim pa shp\u00ebrqendrime.", // EN: Create a cinema mode app for TVs and media devices. Include start movie, volume, ambient lights and distraction-free evening entertainment shortcuts.
    "TV ve medya cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in tek dokunu\u015flu e\u011flence paneli.": "Panel arg\u00ebtimi me nj\u00eb prekje p\u00ebr TV dhe pajisje mediatike.", // EN: One-tap entertainment panel for TVs and media devices.
    "TV, hoparl\u00f6r ve e\u011flence cihazlar\u0131": "TV, altoparlant\u00eb dhe pajisje arg\u00ebtimi", // EN: TVs, speakers and entertainment devices
    "TV, medya kutusu ve ortam \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 tek aksiyonda birle\u015ftir. Film ba\u015flat, gece modu ve dikkat da\u011f\u0131tmayan e\u011flence sahneleri kolayca kurulabilsin.": "Kombinoni TV, kutin\u00eb mediatike dhe dritat ambientale n\u00eb nj\u00eb veprim t\u00eb vet\u00ebm. B\u00ebjeni t\u00eb leht\u00eb p\u00ebr t\u00eb vendosur fillimin e filmit, m\u00ebnyr\u00ebn e nat\u00ebs dhe skenat e arg\u00ebtimit pa shp\u00ebrqendrime.", // EN: Combine the TV, media box and ambient lights in one action. Make it easy to set up start movie, night mode and distraction-free entertainment scenes.
    "Tabii ki! Senin i\u00e7in harika bir ak\u0131ll\u0131 senaryo kurgulayabilirim. Bana biraz detay verir misin? \u00d6rne\u011fin: \"Sabah uyand\u0131\u011f\u0131mda kahve makinesi \u00e7al\u0131\u015fs\u0131n\" veya \"Film izlerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar tamamen k\u0131s\u0131ls\u0131n\" gibi bir istekte bulunabilirsin.": "Sigurisht! Mund t\u00eb bashkoj nj\u00eb skenar t\u00eb shk\u00eblqyer inteligjent p\u00ebr ju. A mund t\u00eb m\u00eb jepni disa detaje? P\u00ebr shembull: \"Nis makin\u00ebn e kafes kur zgjohem\" ose \"Zbeh plot\u00ebsisht dritat kur shikoj nj\u00eb film\".", // EN: Of course! I can put together a great smart scenario for you. Could you give me a few details? For example: "Start the coffee machine when I wake up" or "Dim the lights fully when I watch a movie".
