    "L\u00fctfen ge\u00e7erli bir e-posta gir.": "Ju lutemi shkruani nj\u00eb email t\u00eb vlefsh\u00ebm.", // EN: Please enter a valid email.
    "Bu e-posta ile zaten bir hesap var. L\u00fctfen giri\u015f yap\u0131n.": "Nj\u00eb llogari me k\u00ebt\u00eb email ekziston tashm\u00eb. Ju lutemi identifikohuni.", // EN: An account with this email already exists. Please sign in.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131n\u0131n s\u00fcresi dolmu\u015f ya da ge\u00e7ersiz. L\u00fctfen yeniden dene.": "Ky lidhje ka skaduar ose \u00ebsht\u00eb e pavlefshme. Ju lutemi provoni p\u00ebrs\u00ebri.", // EN: This link has expired or is invalid. Please try again.
    "Bulut hesab\u0131 bu s\u00fcr\u00fcmde kapal\u0131; yerel hesaplarda \u015fifre s\u0131f\u0131rlanamaz.": "Llogaria cloud \u00ebsht\u00eb e \u00e7aktivizuar n\u00eb k\u00ebt\u00eb version; fjal\u00ebkalimet e llogarive lokale nuk mund t\u00eb rivendosen.", // EN: Cloud account is disabled in this build; local account passwords cannot be reset.
    "Bu adres bir hesaba ba\u011fl\u0131ysa s\u0131f\u0131rlama ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 g\u00f6nderildi. Gelen kutunu (ve gereksiz klas\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fc) kontrol et.": "N\u00ebse kjo adres\u00eb \u00ebsht\u00eb e lidhur me nj\u00eb llogari, \u00ebsht\u00eb d\u00ebrguar nj\u00eb lidhje p\u00ebr rivendosje. Kontrolloni kutin\u00eb tuaj t\u00eb post\u00ebs (dhe folderin e spam-it).", // EN: If this address is linked to an account, a reset link has been sent. Check your inbox (and spam folder).
    "\u00c7ok s\u0131k denedin. Bir dakika sonra tekrar dene.": "Shum\u00eb p\u00ebrpjekje. Ju lutem provoni p\u00ebrs\u00ebri pas nj\u00eb minute.", // EN: Too many attempts. Please try again in a minute.
