    "\u015eifren g\u00fcncellendi. \u015eimdi giri\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Fjal\u00ebkalimi juaj \u00ebsht\u00eb p\u00ebrdit\u00ebsuar. Tani mund t\u00eb hyni.", // EN: Your password has been updated. You can sign in now.
