    "Yeni \u015fifre eskisinden farkl\u0131 olmal\u0131.": "Fjal\u00ebkalimi i ri duhet t\u00eb ndryshoj\u00eb nga ai i vjet\u00ebr.", // EN: New password must differ from the old one.
    "Oturum bulunamad\u0131. \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yap\u0131p tekrar giri\u015f yap.": "Seanca nuk u gjet. Dilni dhe hyni p\u00ebrs\u00ebri.", // EN: Session not found. Sign out and sign in again.
