    "Bu e-postan\u0131n hesab\u0131 zaten var; kodla kat\u0131labilir.": "Ky email ka tashm\u00eb nj\u00eb llogari; ata mund t\u00eb bashkohen me kodin.", // EN: This email already has an account; they can join with the code.
