    "Son 7 g\u00fcn": "7 dit\u00ebt e fundit", // EN: Last 7 days
    "Hen\u00fcz kay\u0131tl\u0131 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm yok. G\u00fc\u00e7 \u00f6l\u00e7en bir cihaz ekleyip bu sayfay\u0131 a\u00e7t\u0131\u011f\u0131nda okumalar burada birikir.": "Asnj\u00eb matje nuk \u00ebsht\u00eb regjistruar ende. Shtoni nj\u00eb pajisje q\u00eb mat energjin\u00eb dhe hapni k\u00ebt\u00eb faqe; leximet do t\u00eb grumbullohen k\u00ebtu.", // EN: No measurements recorded yet. Add a device that measures power and open this page; readings will build up here.
    "\u00d6l\u00e7\u00fcm al\u0131nmayan aral\u0131klar hesaba kat\u0131lmaz; bu y\u00fczden de\u011ferler ger\u00e7ek t\u00fcketimden d\u00fc\u015f\u00fck olabilir.": "Intervalet pa matje nuk llogariten, k\u00ebshtu q\u00eb vlerat mund t\u00eb jen\u00eb m\u00eb t\u00eb ul\u00ebta se konsumimi aktual.", // EN: Intervals without measurements are not counted, so values may be lower than actual consumption.
