    "Shelly Smoke Duman Dedekt\u00f6r\u00fc": "Detektori i Duhanit Shelly", // EN: Shelly Smoke Detector
    "Yerel \u015fifreli HTTP (KLAP) \u2014 TP-Link hesab\u0131 e-postas\u0131 + \u015fifresiyle, masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda; priz, anahtar ve ampuller (kamera ve enerji \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm\u00fc hen\u00fcz yok)": "HTTP i koduar lokal (KLAP) \u2014 me emailin dhe fjal\u00ebkalimin e llogaris\u00eb tuaj TP-Link, n\u00eb aplikacionin p\u00ebr desktop; prizat, \u00e7el\u00ebsat dhe llambat (kamera dhe matja e energjis\u00eb nuk jan\u00eb t\u00eb disponueshme ende)", // EN: Local encrypted HTTP (KLAP) — with your TP-Link account email + password, in the desktop app; plugs, switches and bulbs (camera and energy metering not available yet)
