    "Yerel LAN (3.3 / 3.4, \u015fifreli TCP) \u2014 \u00fccretsiz Tuya IoT hesab\u0131ndan al\u0131nan cihaz kimli\u011fi + yerel anahtarla, masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda; priz, anahtar ve ampuller": "LAN lokal (3.3 / 3.4, TCP e koduar) \u2014 me ID e pajisjes + \u00e7el\u00ebsi lokal nga nj\u00eb llogari e lir\u00eb Tuya IoT, n\u00eb aplikacionin p\u00ebr desktop; prizat, \u00e7el\u00ebsat dhe llambat", // EN: Local LAN (3.3 / 3.4, encrypted TCP) — with the device ID + local key from a free Tuya IoT account, in the desktop app; plugs, switches and bulbs
