    "I set up the \"{0}\" automation: it runs {1} and adjusts {2} devices. Automations run while the app is open (also from the tray on desktop).": "Kam vendosur automatizimin \"{0}\": ai funksionon {1} dhe rregullon {2} pajisje. Automatizimet funksionojn\u00eb nd\u00ebrsa aplikacioni \u00ebsht\u00eb i hapur (edhe nga toolbar-i n\u00eb desktop).", // EN: I set up the "{0}" automation: it runs {1} and adjusts {2} devices. Automations run while the app is open (also from the tray on desktop).
